{"3493290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KNIGHTCORE", "steam_appid": 3493290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the slow pace of medieval slashers. <strong>KNIGHTCORE</strong> is built around fast and brutal duels in the spirit of arena shooters — but with swords, axes, and medieval chaos. Fight 1v1, 2v2, or FFA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.poster.avif?t=1779473728\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.webm?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.mp4?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dash, jump, and kick matters. Parry any attack, projectile, or even fall damage. Find your rhythm — and turn a deflected strike into the decisive blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.poster.avif?t=1779473728\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.webm?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.mp4?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ weapons</strong> — each radically changing your mobility and attack style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50</strong> unique arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock armor sets and weapon skins by completing achievements, and show off your accomplishments on the battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the slow pace of medieval slashers. <strong>KNIGHTCORE</strong> is built around fast and brutal duels in the spirit of arena shooters — but with swords, axes, and medieval chaos. Fight 1v1, 2v2, or FFA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.poster.avif?t=1779473728\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.webm?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/5f33ab788b91b83999b774dd6988f251.mp4?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dash, jump, and kick matters. Parry any attack, projectile, or even fall damage. Find your rhythm — and turn a deflected strike into the decisive blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.poster.avif?t=1779473728\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.webm?t=1779473728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493290/extras/36cc9834b1daf6592562aab7c4a2b7e7.mp4?t=1779473728\" t